{"match": "(?=.*split_magic)(?=.*健壮性)", "verdict": "false-positive", "note": "false-positive。\n\nfinding 说「`:(glob)` 没闭合 / 多个逗号会解析出非预期结果，建议加 fallback」。\n\n**实测**：未闭合时 `end == -1` 分支**已经返回** `([], pattern)`（fallback 已在）；多个逗号由 `split(\",\")` 正常处理；`split_magic(':(glob,)*.py')` -> `(['glob'], '*.py')`。\n\n=> 且未闭合的 magic 会让 git 报错 => 探针 `CalledProcessError` => 守卫**已 fail-closed 报红**。\n=> 判 false-positive。", "adjudicatedAt": "2026-11-13T12:42:00Z", "severity": "P2", "expiresAt": "2027-11-13T12:42:00Z"}
